{"id":10108,"name":"persian-alola","speciesId":53,"dex":53,"form":"alolan","generation":1,"types":["dark"],"stats":{"hp":65,"attack":60,"defense":60,"special-attack":75,"special-defense":65,"speed":115},"abilities":[{"name":"fur-coat","hidden":false},{"name":"technician","hidden":false},{"name":"rattled","hidden":true}],"height":11,"weight":330,"baseExp":154,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10108.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10108.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10108.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10108.ogg","genus":"Classy Cat Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon gato elegante","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness."},{"version":"yellow","text":"The gem in its forehead glows on its own! It walks with all the grace and elegance of a proud queen."},{"version":"gold","text":"Many adore it for its sophisticated air. However, it will lash out and scratch for little reason."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant."},{"version":"crystal","text":"Behind its lithe, elegant appearance lies a barbaric side. It will tear apart its prey on a mere whim."},{"version":"ruby","text":"PERSIAN has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the POKéMON’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A PERSIAN’s six bold whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in its vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"version":"firered","text":"Has a vicious temperament. Beware if it raises its tail straight up. It is a signal that it is about to pounce and bite."},{"version":"diamond","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Persian has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the Pokémon’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"version":"sun","text":"It has a violent temperament. It will attack anything that looks it in the eye. Its sharp claws inflict deep wounds."},{"version":"moon","text":"It has a high opinion of itself, although not to the same extent as the Alolan Persian. It’s quite difficult to make friends with this Pokémon."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although the jewel on its forehead appears to be a different color than those of Alolan Persian, it’s mostly made of the same material."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"This Pokémon is popular with rich people. It’s also targeted by hunters who are after the jewel in its forehead."},{"version":"sword","text":"Getting this prideful Pokémon to warm up to you takes a lot of effort, and it will claw at you the moment it gets annoyed."},{"version":"shield","text":"Its elegant and refined behavior clashes with that of the barbaric Perrserker. The relationship between the two is one of mutual disdain."}],"flavorPt":"Seu comportamento elegante e refinado contrasta com o do bárbaro Perrserker. A relação entre os dois é de desdém mútuo.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":90,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"meowth","speciesId":52,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28","Felicidade alta"],"species":"persian","speciesId":53,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Nível 28"],"species":"perrserker","speciesId":863,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":53,"name":"persian","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/53.p